  50:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * The IMO must be enabled before calling this function. The operation of the
  51:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * flash writing hardware is dependent on the IMO.
  52:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** *
  53:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * For PSoC 4000, PSoC 4100 BLE and PSoC 4200 BLE devices (PSoC 4100 BLE and
  54:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * PSoC 4200 BLE devices with 256K of Flash memory are not affected), this API
  55:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * will automatically modify the clock settings for the device. Writing to
  56:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * flash requires that changes be made to the IMO and HFCLK settings. The
  57:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * configuration is restored before returning. This will impact the operation
  58:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * of most of the hardware in the device.
