  60:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * For PSoC 4000 devices this API will automatically modify the clock settings
  61:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * for the device. Writing to flash requires that changes be made to the IMO
  62:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * and HFCLK settings. The configuration is restored before returning. HFCLK
  63:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * will have several frequency changes during the operation of this API between
  64:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * a minimum frequency of the current IMO frequency divided by 8 and a maximum
  65:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * frequency of 12 MHz. This will impact the operation of most of the hardware
  66:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * in the device.
