 363:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * non-blocking operation. It is advised not to prolong calling this API for
 364:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * more than 25 ms.
 365:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** *
 366:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * The non-blocking write row API \ref CySysFlashStartWriteRow() requires that
 367:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * this API be called 3 times to complete the write. This can be done by
 368:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * configuring SPCIF interrupt and placing a call to this API.
 369:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** *
 370:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * For CM0 based device, a non-blocking call to program a row of macro 0
 371:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * requires the user to set the CPUSS_CONFIG.VECS_IN_RAM bit so that the
 372:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * interrupt vector for the SPC is fetched from the SRAM rather than the FLASH.
 373:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** *
