 374:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * For CM0+ based device, if the user wants to keep the vector table in flash
 375:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * when performing non-blocking flash write then they need to make sure the
 376:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * vector table is placed in the flash macro which is not getting programmed by
