 379:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * \note The non-blocking operation does not return success status 
 380:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * CY_SYS_FLASH_SUCCESS until the last Resume API is complete. 
 381:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyFlash.c **** * The CPUSS_SYSARG register will be reflecting the SRAM address during an 
